 Multi-User Transition Plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 Overview                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 Transform nexor from a single-user app into a per-user isolated system with email/password + GitHub OAuth authentication. Rust backend only — frontend ticket written separately.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 Execution Order                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 WS1 (Schema) → WS2 (Auth) → WS3 (Data Isolation) + WS4 (Resources) + WS5 (Route Protection)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                                     ↑ these three can run in parallel after WS2 ↑                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
 WS1: Database Schema Migration                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 Create: migrations/015_multi_user.sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
 - users table: id UUID PK, email UNIQUE, password_hash (nullable), github_id UNIQUE, github_login, github_token_encrypted, created_at, updated_at                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
 - Add user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) to 12 tables: tasks, agents, chat_messages, tickets, prds, planning_sessions, cost_records, llm_calls, decisions, refactor_sessions, pr_merge_queue, vertical_slices                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
 - Create a default legacy user (00000000-...0001) and backfill all existing rows before setting NOT NULL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
 - Add idx_*_user_id indexes on all new columns                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
