 Modify: src/config/credentials.rs — add NEXOR_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY env var for encrypting stored GitHub tokens                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
